OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 29 Oct to Sat 7 NovFA
OL,6,Fband of rain will make increasingly
OL,7,Ferratic eastwards progress at the
OL,8,Fstart of this period, whilst tending
OL,9,Fto fizzle out, as high pressure
OL,10,Fbecomes more dominant in the vicinity
OL,11,Fof the UK. Into early November and
OL,12,Fhigh pressure will most likely
OL,13,Fcontinue to be dominant feature near
OL,14,Fthe UK, meaning drier than normal
OL,15,Fconditions for most if not all, though
OL,16,Fit could be rather cloudy and grey at
OL,17,Ftimes. If light winds and/or clear
OL,18,Fskies combine overnight, then areas of
OL,19,Ffog could develop, as would be typical
OL,20,Fat this time of year. Overall,
OL,21,Ftemperatures are likely to be close to
OL,22,Fnormal, but with the potential for
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fcold nights with some frost around.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
