OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 8 Nov to Sun 22 Nov
OL,6,FPerhaps mostly settled to start,
OL,7,Fperhaps with some chilly nights, but
OL,8,Fas we move further into November,
OL,9,Fthere is an increased chance of more
OL,10,Funsettled conditions developing, with
OL,11,Fa return to spells of rain and
OL,12,Fpossible strong winds. However, the
OL,13,Fextent and location of areas which
OL,14,Fwould be wetter and/or windier is
OL,15,Funcertain and may not occur in the
OL,16,Fclimatologically wettest areas.
OL,17,FOverall temperatures probably near or
OL,18,Fa little above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
